  not exercised by any runnable example).
* **``Scene.plot(path)``** instance method — the last bit
  of friction on plot_scene.
* **Font fallback chain** — so PIL can render Unicode arrows
  + other glyphs that Cinzel lacks.
* **Pyglet render** — still blocked.
* **Second user** — still outstanding.

