| issue                                   | severity              |
|-----------------------------------------|-----------------------|
| UI/Typography alignment                 | recurring / cosmetic  |
| Font style inconsistency                | PIL artifact          |
| Safe-area violations (edge margins)     | real / minor          |
| Asteroid asset repetition               | real / mild           |
| Bottom-left controls readability        | real / minor          |

No structural bugs or layout collisions. A reasonable
launch state for a ~230-line example.

